    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/patsaindon/chocolatey-packages/tree/main/internal/vdhcoapp</packageSourceUrl>
    <description>VideoDownloadHelper Companion App (CoApp) -- the native helper application the VideoDownloadHelper browser extension (Firefox/Chrome) uses to merge, convert, and save downloaded video/audio streams to disk.</description>
